description:
Design a 5-bit shift register with functionality for left and right shifting, loading new data, and synchronous reset. The register shifts its contents left or right based on the select signals (sl for left shift and sr for right shift) when enabled (en). It can load an input value (d_in) when the load signal (ld) is asserted, and it resets to zero when the reset signal (rst) is active. The shifting operations include the option to insert a specified bit (lb for left and rb for right) at the respective ends during the shift operations.
module top_module(input clk, rst, ld, sl, sr, en, lb, rb,
	input[4:0] d_in,
	output reg [4:0] q_out
    );

