description:
Design a 2-to-4 decoder that takes a 2-bit binary input and generates a 4-bit output. For each unique input value (00, 01, 10, 11), only one corresponding output line will be asserted high while the others remain low, effectively translating the 2-bit input into a one-hot encoded output format.
module top_module(
  input [1:0] in,
  output [3:0] out
);

code:
